  )
  (text "Optional: External VCC Imput" (at 154.686 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 957b1c37-2fdf-4d0a-97d1-81c255d63503)
  )
  (text "Pin SAVE This pin is an open drain output with\ninternal pull-up resistor to VIF. In case of \nbreak-down of the bus voltage for more than \ntyp. 1.5 ms (save condition) this pin delivers \nan active LOW signal to external host \nelectronic."
    (at 343.916 341.122 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 96c1751c-d364-4ffc-94f8-2ac1365705df)
  )
  (text "Optional - Flash" (at 478.79 128.27 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9c2d8ff7-5d64-4467-aec5-19a7963c1373)
  )
  (text "Component values:\nC1 - 100nF\nC2 - 100nF\n\nC4 - 100nF\nC5 - 100nF 25v\nC6 - 10uF 16v\nC7 - 100nF\n\nD1 - Prog LED\nD2 - SMAJ40CA-13-F (Optional)\nD3 - SD1206S020S1R0 20V 1A \n      (Schottky Barrier Rectifier Diode) or 1N5819\n\nShort if no Adum1201 is used!\nR1 - 0Ohm-Jumper: KNX TX -> RX \nR2 - 0Ohm-Jumper: KNX RX <- TX\nR3 - 100 Ohm\nR6 - 10k Ohm"
    (at 473.71 338.8868 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9f77a0d0-6477-4472-80f4-deeb25174535)
  )
  (text "OPTIONAL: Additional FLASH" (at 383.286 121.666 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9fad27b4-8814-45c5-aaa4-1d6ad2b8426a)
  )
  (text "If you only want to use the delivered \nKNX VCC without External power source, \nyou can solder: JP1 -> 2+3 for 5V or \nJP1 -> 1+2 for 3V3.\n\nOnly in combination with Jumper Settings\n\"KNX 3V3 Only\" or \"KNX 5V Only\". \n\nBridged JP6 reults that the  \n\"EXT_VCC_IN\" will be then the selected\nVCC OUT!"
    (at 324.866 168.656 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a091520e-7402-4764-b6ea-a7073d051139)
  )
